    "updated_at": "2022-06-05T09:56:12Z",
    "body": "I ran the installer as myself and it asked for my sudo password, so it seems installation as root is the default, at least for this method & platform. Alternatively, there could be a choice to install to `~/.local/bin/` (or even just `~/bin/`) to make it usable for users without sudo privileges?",
